OL,3,GNEWSAMajor search for fishing boat with
OL,4,Athree-man crew missing off Western
OL,5,AIsles
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major search is under way off the
OL,8,FWestern Isles for a fishing boat with
OL,9,Fthree men onboard that has been
OL,10,Freported missing.
OL,12,FThe alarm was raised at about 21:20 on
OL,13,FTuesday when it emerged the boat was
OL,14,Foverdue from Lewis.
OL,16,FThe Maritime and Coastguard Agency
OL,17,F(MCA) said a plane and two helicopters
OL,18,Fwere making searches.
OL,20,FSix coastguard rescue teams, two RNLI
OL,21,Flifeboats, a local boat and Police
OL,22,FScotland have also been involved.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
